title: 'Cross-Study Team Verdict: 6 features scoped, 4 security prerequisites, university shipped'
summary: 'Full team analysis (Architect, Sage, Jinx, Sentinel) on 6 cross-study features from OpenSpace/AnyTool/ClawWork/World Monitor. Jinx killed 2 outright (semantic retrieval, time-based staleness), reshaped 4 others. Final scope: gap narration (doctor-only), activity metrics (not dollar costs), soft provenance (not full DAG), outcome reference tracking (data collection only), change-based health (compliance trends), tool aliases (not embeddings). Also shipped v5.31.0 university restructuring: 8 courses, 82 lessons, PARA 001 Quick Start, 5 new lessons across PARA 301/401/501, quiz WHAT→HOW upgrades.'
