body: '## Session Overview\n\nTwo major workstreams in one session:\n\n### 1. University Restructuring (v5.31.0 — SHIPPED)\n\n8-phase restructuring based on prior session''s audit:\n- PARA 001: Quick Start (3 lessons, 9 quizzes — shift→team→build)\n- PARA 101: First Steps moved from lesson 8→2\n- PARA 201: Aspect Graph condensed 10,688→3,376 chars\n- PARA 301: +2 lessons (Enforcement Levels, paradigm shift)\n- PARA 401: Agent Roles rewritten (5→54 bridge, Rune), +1 Quick-Check lesson\n- PARA 501: +1 Conductor Workspace lesson\n- Quiz upgrades WHAT→HOW across PARA 101, 201, 301\n- All new content written HOW-first (scenario-based)\n\n### 2. Cross-Study Research + Team Analysis\n\n4 repos studied in parallel (4 architect agents):\n- OpenSpace (HKUDS): self-evolving skills, lineage DAG, outcome metrics\n- AnyTool (HKUDS): progressive tool filtering, semantic retrieval\n- ClawWork (HKUDS): economic survival benchmark, quality gates\n- World Monitor (koala73): 30+ source correlation, staleness, gap narration\n\n4 team agents analyzed 6 proposed features in parallel:\n- Architect: full system designs with data structures and file locations\n- Sage: UX evaluation across 3 developer personas\n- Jinx: stress-tested all 6, killed 2, reshaped 4\n- Sentinel: security audit, found 4 critical prerequisites\n\n## Implementation Priority (Post-Session)\n\nP1: Gap Narration (doctor + postflight only) — S scope\nP2: Activity Metrics (tool calls, not dollars) — S-M scope\nP3: Soft Provenance (optional lineage fields) — S scope\nP4: Outcome Reference Tracking (data collection) — M scope\nP5: Change-Based Health (compliance trends) — S-M scope\nP6: Tool Aliases (not semantic retrieval) — S scope\n\nSecurity prerequisites: 4 items ship before/alongside P1.'
